SHEPHERD-VITA DIAG patch (devfail1, 2026-10-07): DIAG-ONLY hooks for the PS Vita runtime, on top of dotnet-runtime-v8.0.31-shepherd-vita.patch.
Apply to a COPY of the fork's src/mono (vita/toolchain/build-runtime-diag.sh does), never to the shared checkout. Every hook is
line-neutral and empty without -DSHEPHERD_VITA_DIAG: the patched tree compiles to the normal objects (build-runtime-diag.sh prove).

